 	# Local partition CPU change tests
-	" C0-5:P2  C4-5:P1  .      .      .    C3-5     .      .     0 A1:0-2|A2:3-5 A1:P2|A2:P1 0-2"
-	" C0-5:P2  C4-5:P1  .      .    C1-5     .      .      .     0 A1:1-3|A2:4-5 A1:P2|A2:P1 1-3"
